      "id": "MAC-HMACSHA1",
      "layer": "L1 source",
      "expectedLevel": "warning",
      "description": "[舊做法] HmacSHA1",
      "match": "HMAC.?SHA-?1(?![0-9])",
      "endpoints": [
        "hash/hmac-sha1-legacy"
      ],
      "note": "規則 hmac-sha1：HMAC 不受 SHA-1 碰撞影響、NIST 仍允許，所以是 warning 而不是 violation（2026-11-14 定案）；程式裡標的是 [舊做法]"
    },
